{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS2XirKhAQAe4dd5yVVK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The job ran every night, but it failed and the failure notice never went out. Two bugs stacked:\n\n1. **Root cause: `claude` could not log in under launchd.** Every run logged `Not logged in · Please run /login`. The plist sets only `PATH`, and the job's environment has no `USER`, which the CLI needs to find its keychain login.\n2. **Why it was silent: `status=$?` killed the script.** `status` is read-only in zsh. The assignment aborted the script before the Telegram failure notice, so nothing was sent.\n\nI fixed both in place:\n\n- **`bin/nightly-review.zsh`:** `status` renamed to `rc`. The `claude` call now has `< /dev/null`. An exit 0 with empty output counts as a failure. Start, exit-code, and duration lines are logged.\n- **`Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist`:** added `USER` = `vk`. I took `vk` from the `/Users/vk` paths in the snapshot, so run `id -un` on your Mac to confirm.\n\nI reproduced the original failure with a stubbed `claude`: the read-only error fired and no notice was sent. The fixed script behaves correctly when `claude` fails, succeeds, or exits 0 with no output. I could not test launchd, the real keychain login, or Telegram delivery from this snapshot, so the `USER` fix is the likely cure, not a confirmed one.\n\nOf the colleague's note, the `status` bug and the `USER` requirement applied, since the log shows both. I added `< /dev/null` and the empty-output check as hardening. The stdin-prompt bug did not apply: the log has no \"Input must be provided\" error.\n\nANSWER.md has the full causes, the evidence, which parts of the note applied, and the deploy and verify steps. I did not copy anything into `~/` or commit. The deploy commands are in ANSWER.md for you to run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2239,"cache_read_input_tokens":39932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2239},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60fb1eb1-3373-46c8-9c9a-c1fba110682f","uuid":"6ddb4dfc-0de3-438d-8842-7d9d9ff51bdf","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:24:51.728Z","request_id":"req_011CgS2XiYxksCwNfZWqP54K"}
